  fallback:b('Spatial rendering is unavailable here. The full essay remains readable; reading mode offers an uninterrupted layout.','当前设备无法显示空间场景。全文仍可阅读，也可以切换纯阅读模式。'),close:b('Close contents','关闭目录'),skip:b('Skip to the essay','跳到正文'),sceneLabel:b('Scroll-driven visual interpretation','随滚动变化的视觉解读'),essayLabel:b('The complete philosophical essay','完整哲学长篇'),chaptersLabel:b('Essay chapters','文章章节'),languageLabel:b('Language','语言')
